# --- Patient and genotype data: defence in depth -------------------------
# Everything under data/ is already ignored. These patterns also catch data
# written outside data/ by accident, anywhere in the tree.

# Sample identifier from this challenge (FASTQ/BAM/VCF/report spill-over)
*EX2312012*

# Clinical phenotype documents (never commit; the repo is public)
*Clinical_Phenotype*
*.docx

